"The system settings were auto-detected. CiviCRM will be installed with:"
msgstr "Systeminställningarna var automatiska upptäckta. CiviCRM installeras med:"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CMS Database"
msgstr "CMS-databas"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CiviCRM Database"
msgstr "CiviCRM Databas"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "Apply"
msgstr "Applicera"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"By default, CiviCRM uses the same database as your website. You may install "
"on a separate database if you need more fine-grained control over "
"permissions, replication, hardware capacity, etc."
msgstr "Som standard använder CiviCRM samma databas som din webbplats. Du kan installera på en separat databas om du behöver mer finkornig kontroll över behörigheter, replikering, hårdvarukapacitet etc."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "<strong>Example</strong>: <code>%1</code>"
msgstr "<strong>Exempel</strong>: <code>%1</code>"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Tip: This uses URL notation. If the credentials require any special "
"characters (e.g. \"&\" or \"#\"), then apply URL encoding (e.g. \"%26\" or "
"\"%23\")."
msgstr "Tips: Detta använder URL-notation. Om referenserna kräver några speciella tecken (t.ex. \"&\" eller \"#\"), tillämpa sedan URL-kodning (t.ex. \"%26\" eller \"%23\")."

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CiviCRM Settings File"
msgstr "CiviCRM Inställningar File"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid "CiviCRM Source Code"
msgstr "CiviCRM Källakod"

#: setup/plugins/blocks/advanced.tpl.php
msgid ""
"Need more advanced control? You may alternatively use the <a href=\"%1\" "
"target=\"%2\">command-line installer</a>."
msgstr "Behöver du mer avancerad kontroll? Du kan alternativt använda <a href=\"%1\" target=\"%2\"> kommandoradsinstallationsprogrammet </a>."

